pd","topic":"娱乐","uid":"4acc5b346b24885f81892dbf2dea9711f4b87c2be7d3c1d813b4c837d2ea19a5"},{"alias":"tnews365","day":"2026-11-23","html":"<article class=\"g-card card news card--text\" data-cat=\"全球\" data-ch=\"tnews365\"><div class=\"g-card__label\"><span class=\"g-card__who\"><span class=\"source\" data-source=\"tnews365\">竹新社</span><span class=\"cat\">全球</span></span><time datetime=\"2026-11-23T00:22:07+08:00\">00:22</time></div><h2 class=\"card__title\"><a href=\"https://t.me/tnews365/35802\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">韩国教育部长官崔教振11月22日辞职</a></h2><p class=\"card__body\">为应对AI技术作弊，2027学年度大学修学能力考试（高考）临近仅几天内多次紧急调整防作弊对策，引发混乱。崔教振还作出意为“没有信心查出作弊行为”的言论，招致更大非议。\n崔教振称，本次高考筹备过程给考生及国民带来不便，对此深感责任重大，因此决定辞职。总统李在明当天就受理了辞呈。\n（韩联社）</p><div class=\"card__actions\"><button class=\"g-btn g-btn--text expand\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>展开全文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-chevron-down\"/></svg></button><a class=\"g-btn g-btn--text\" href=\"https://t.me/tnews365/35802\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>阅读原文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-external-link\"/></svg></a><button class=\"icon-btn bookmark\" type=\"button\" data-bookmark=\"{&quot;id&quot;: &quot;4633aef2dbdb9c5f2aaf5ebb766b84517e0e2699c8981a041342c53d553ba37a&quot;, &quot;title&quot;: &quot;韩国教育部长官崔教振11月22日辞职&quot;, &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://t.me/tnews365/35802&quot;, &quot;source&quot;: &quot;竹新社&quot;, &quot;time&quot;: &quot;2026-11-23T00:22:07+08:00&quot;, &quot;snippet&quot;: &quot;为应对AI技术作弊，2027学年度大学修学能力考试（高考）临近仅几天内多次紧急调整防作弊对策，引发混乱。崔教振还作出意为“没有信心查出作弊行为”的言论，招致更大非议。\\n崔教振称，本次高考筹备过程给考生及国民带来不便，对此深感责任重大，因此决定辞职。总统李在明当天就受理了辞呈。\\n（韩联社）&quot;}\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"收藏\"><span class=\"ph-bookmark\"><svg class=\"phosphor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M184,32H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,48V